@echo off
rem OCTOPUS-flags.cmd - non-secret flag overrides, called by RUN-ORGANISM.bat before python.
rem ASCII-only: cmd.exe parses this in the OEM codepage, so no non-ASCII chars here.
rem Remove a line (or the whole file) and restart to turn a layer off.

rem Session 46: hybrid heart SHADOW beat + beat-paced work pump (zero-cost lanes) + nudges.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_HEART=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_HEART_WORK=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_NEEDS_NUDGE=1
rem HARVEST خاموش شد 2026-07-17: اعتبارسنجیِ زنده نشان داد AusTender منبعِ ضعیفِ
rem لیدِ نقاشی است (۱ مورد در ۴۰۰ قرارداد/ماه؛ atmPublished=۴۰۰). کد صحیح است ولی
rem تا وصلِ منبعِ واقعی (Gmail inbound / PlanningAlerts DA) خاموش می‌ماند.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_HARVEST=0
set OCTOPUS_OBS_ALERT=1
rem Session 46 P0 security fixes: enforce human-append anti-forgery (is_human downgraded to 0
rem for tokenless appends; money settle path untouched) and wire apply_merge so owner merge
rem verdicts have real effect. Both fail-safe and rollbackable.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_HUMAN_APPEND_GUARD=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_APPLY_MERGE=1

rem 2027 Standards Base backlog item #1, owner verdict 2026-07-12: close the last no-secret
rem loophole. If boot-time configure() in organism.py ever fails (caught, non-fatal today),
rem the module-level guard used to fall back to passthrough (allow). STRICT makes that one
rem edge case fail-closed (deny) instead. Zero effect on the normal path: organism.py already
rem configures a real per-boot secret, so this only guards the failure branch. Tested:
rem test_human_append_guard.py checks 11/12/15 (15/15 green). Delete this line to revert.
set HH_HUMAN_GUARD_STRICT=1

rem GO-LIVE (owner informed decision 2026-07-10, tier 1+2): shadow to real (zero-cost) - heart
rem allometry + production-wire condition + doctor RFC persistence. Core safety UNTOUCHED:
rem budget cap AU30/month, kill-switch, sigma cap, human-append. The ACTIVATION-*.flag files
rem open the paid/date gates; delete any flag to revert.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_BIO=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_PULSE=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_DOCTOR_PERSIST=1
REM P10 truth-map 2026-07-17: OCTOPUS_WIRE_SELF_IMPROVE_AUTO retired (zero readers in any code); real gate = ACTIVATION-SELF-IMPROVE-AUTO.flag file

rem Gate-0 needs real self-delta samples on a fixed clock; 15-min cadence means heart
rem live-control legitimately opens in about 12h of data (not faked). Set 3600 for hourly.
set HEART_SAMPLE_INTERVAL_S=900

rem Metacognitive layer: free zero-cost web research (DuckDuckGo + Wikipedia + arXiv, no API
rem key, read-only). Queries come only from generic school-gap topics, never private content.
rem Delete this line to disable outbound web egress.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_WEB_RESEARCH=1

rem Self-evolution unlock (owner 2026-07-11 "open the locks, let it evolve itself").
rem Evolution is already on via the paper-full profile (sandbox mutations -> RFC proposals,
rem owner-merge to become real). These add the remaining safe subsystems:
rem   SCHEDULER  - propose-only dispatcher (zero-cost, only schedules, no effector).
rem   EPISTEMICS - advisory read-only self-knowledge sensor (zero-cost, annotate only).
rem   SELFHEAL   - auto-recover a failed leg, bounded by a circuit-breaker (max 3 / 5min).
rem   DEBATE     - creative-vs-architect loop (PAID, capped AU10/month, respects kill-switch).
rem NOT unlocked here: real measured_lift / L4 auto code-patching (self-modification core -
rem needs explicit owner vote). Evolution stays propose-only; core safety unchanged.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_SCHEDULER=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_EPISTEMICS=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_SELFHEAL=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_DEBATE=1

rem Mining leg activation (owner verdict 2026-07-12). Read-only, propose-only, secrets=(),
rem money_link=incubating, budget=0, spawn=0. Structurally contained (D-10/D-11/D-20).
rem NOT added to PAPER_FULL_FLAGS - explicit opt-in only. Delete this line to deactivate.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_MINING=1

rem TG-exec (2026-07-15, owner "do it"): Telegram cockpit buttons doctor:run / consolidate:run
rem actually execute on the beat thread (halt-gated, at-most-once, no money, no 3rd-party
rem outbound; doctor posts an owner-only RFC card). school/ingest stay disabled. Delete to revert.
set OCTOPUS_TG_EXEC=1

rem TG group power tier (2026-07-18, owner "روشن کن کنترلِ کامل"): unlocks Tier-B two-tap
rem control in the group command centre — restart / flag-toggle / budget-apply (arm->confirm,
rem 180s expiry, owner-from-id gated, money-settle still locked). Emergency brake + leg
rem pause/resume are always-on regardless. Revert: set to 0 or delete this line, relaunch centre.
set OCTOPUS_TG_POWER=1

rem Autonomy re-tier (2026-07-16 19:30, owner verbatim: "human gate ONLY for important items,
rem interactive Telegram; free the rest - decide and act, don't ask"). Non-important proposals
rem get a logged SELF verdict (ledger AUTONOMY_SELF_VERDICT) instead of owner escalation.
rem IMPORTANT class is hard-coded in cortex/autonomy_matrix.py and NEVER freed by this flag:
rem money/spend, secrets, delete, outbound send/publish, code/merge, genome/ledger/schema,
rem kill/halt/restart, spawn, sigma, human-append, PII/partner. Delete this line to revert.
set OCTOPUS_AUTONOMY_FREE=1

rem Program 1 (2026-07-16, owner approved the 10-program wave): lead engine stages 1-5 go live
rem (SENSE file-inbox -> score -> ledger PROPOSAL -> priced draft quote). propose-only, ZERO
rem outbound - no send capability exists in _ops at all. Plus heart telemetry + struct logs.
rem Delete any line to revert that layer.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_LEAD_DISCOVERY=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_LEAD_DRAFT=0
set HEARTSTATE_SHADOW=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_STRUCTLOG=1

rem Brain economics (2026-07-16, owner "free local, paid only for big work"): the 7B model
rem (qwen2.5:latest, 4.7GB) is already on disk and fits the 1660Ti - a big free quality jump
rem over the 1.5b default. LOCAL_FIRST: mid-tier tasks (research/synthesize/draft) try the
rem local 7B first behind a deterministic quality gate; paid GLM/Fugu only on failure or for
rem heavy tiers (plan/deep/orchestrate). Delete either line to revert.
set OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:latest
set CORTEX_LOCAL_FIRST=1

rem 2026-07-18 owner vote "faster + smarter" phase A (boot-think): the cortex thinks every
rem cycle including cycle 1 (warm from boot, not ~50min after restart). Default in code is 5;
rem this flag is the whole deploy - delete this line to revert. Phase B (local-first quality
rem gate) lives in code with no flag: echo/degenerate local answers now escalate to paid.
set CORTEX_THINK_EVERY_N=1

rem 2026-07-18 owner vote (same day, follow-up "roshan kon"): phase C ON. CORTISOL_EVENTS =
rem fear-ENTRY edge -> immediate paid primary synthesis with alarm context; persistent 4h
rem cooldown (OCTOPUS_CORTISOL_COOLDOWN_S), WORK-LLM lane lock + honest paid-gate check;
rem first observation only baselines (no auto-spend at boot even mid-chronic-fear).
rem SYNTH_EVENT_DRIVEN = the 24h timer synthesis skips the paid call when inputs are
rem unchanged since last digest (saves spend); a cortisol alarm always bypasses the dedup.
rem Delete either line to revert. CORTEX_ROUTE_SCORER stays off (separate, not part of C-core).
set OCTOPUS_CORTISOL_EVENTS=1
set OCTOPUS_SYNTH_EVENT_DRIVEN=1

rem Hardware-tuned heartbeat (2026-07-16, owner asked): Legion 5 = 12 threads / 16GB RAM
rem (5.8GB free measured) / GTX 1660Ti 6GB. The 7B model (4.7GB) saturates VRAM, cold-load
rem ~60s, warm answer ~15s - so: 120s LLM timeout (no false-dead on cold load), 20s min gap
rem between local calls (GPU+RAM breathing room beside Obsidian/Chrome), heart self-delta
rem sampling stays 900s (already set above - right for 16GB), lead discovery capped 3/beat
rem and every ~30 beats. Minimum-aliveness floor is TICK_SECONDS=300 in organism.py (code
rem constant, untouched): even with a depleted beat-budget the organism wakes every 5min
rem for kill-check+telemetry - the true "alive minimum" costs ~0% CPU idle.
set OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_S=120
set OLLAMA_MIN_INTERVAL_S=20
set LEAD_DISCOVERY_MAX_PER_BEAT=3
set CHRONO_LEAD_DISCOVERY_EVERY_N_BEATS=30
set OCTOPUS_HTTP_AUTH=1
set EVOLVE_REQUIRE_APPROVAL=1
rem TG_CENTER_BOT_TOKEN و TG_CENTER_CHAT_ID به .env منتقل شدند (2026-07-18): secret‌ها
rem باید در .env (gitignored) باشند، نه در flags.cmd (که non-secret toggle‌هاست).
rem اگر بعداً نیاز به override شد، این‌جا دوباره اضافه کن.
rem 2026-07-17 phase-1 money-heart: PocketSmith read-only sync (developer key, GET-only, no money movement).
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_POCKETSMITH=1

rem 2026-07-18 full Accounting activation (owner verdict "درست کردن همش"):
rem   ACCT_BEAT  - daily accounting heartbeat (local-only: memory rebuild + journal queue + counts).
rem   ACCT_BEAT_SYNC - pull network from PocketSmith inside the beat (confirm-preserving, GET-only).
rem   Together they make /sync automatic once per ~4h epoch (CHRONO_ACCT_EVERY_N_BEATS=240).
rem   Zero money movement, zero auto-post — propose-only stays intact.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_ACCT_BEAT=1
set ACCT_BEAT_SYNC=1

rem RD-004 (owner verdict 2026-07-16 "پاکت‌اسمیتم سینک باشه"): the single narrow exception
rem to the zero-write doctrine. PUT only `labels` (oct-owner-* / oct-type-*) to
rem /transactions/{id} — never amount/date/category. Hardened with 5-lens adversarial verify
rem (ceiling=40/flush, deadline=60s, idempotent pre-GET, HALT-first, exclusive lock,
rem one-time auto-backfill). Owner labels untouched. This is the only outbound write in Accounting.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_PS_WRITEBACK=1

rem 2026-07-18 owner verdict "Ollama رو وصل کن": local-first categorization guess for /review.
rem Only desc without amounts (txn_categorize.scrub_pii -> all numbers become [num]),
rem on-device via qwen2.5:latest (already set above), zero cloud. Propose-only — never auto-confirms.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_ACCT_REVIEW_LLM=1

rem Doctor self-knowledge loop (2026-07-18, owner "دکتر باهوش و فعال"): from boot, a
rem read-only understanding of Octopus via local Ollama ($0), saved + iteratively improved.
rem NOT fear-gated (learning != change); runs in a daemon thread (never blocks the tick).
rem Paid brain only if OCTOPUS_DOCTOR_SELFKNOW_PAID=1 (cortisol, money-gated).
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_DOCTOR_SELFKNOW=1
rem 2026-07-18 (owner: make the telegram buttons real): three additive, reversible layers.
rem  PROPOSAL_BUTTONS   - leg-proposal cards get real yes/no/later buttons (measurement-only, never settles).
rem  DOCTOR_KNOB_RFC    - doctor proposes bounded tune-knob self-changes to the owner via Telegram (propose-only).
rem  MERGE_APPLIES_KNOB - owner merge-tap on a tune RFC really applies the whitelisted knob (bounded, reversible).
rem  High-risk (code/money/genome) stays lesson-only and escalates. Delete any line to revert.
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_PROPOSAL_BUTTONS=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_DOCTOR_KNOB_RFC=1
set OCTOPUS_WIRE_MERGE_APPLIES_KNOB=1
